'' A STRING CAST REACHING A STRING PARAMETER OF ITS OWN WIDTH beats one changing width: over { byref const wstring, byref const string } a 'byref as zstring' cast picks string and a 'byref as wstring' one wstring (fbc's structs/implicit-cast.bas). tiko called it ambiguous. Expected output is fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/strcast-same-width-overload.bas -o tests/codegen/strcastsamewidthoverload.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/strcastsamewidthoverload.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: wstring        string
